    {
      "text": "It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life forms can survive.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "KINGDRA lives at extreme ocean depths that are otherwise uninhabited. It has long been believed that the yawning of this POKéMON creates spiraling ocean currents.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
